For the front end folder ‘ social ‘ - execute by running npm start

And for the folder ‘ Backend’ , we run by executing - python manage.py runserver.

Unfortunately before being able to run the backend, I have to download the following Django dependencies again as it keeps deleting by default

Firstly - pip install django 

Secondly - pip install djangorestframework

Thirdly - pip install requests

Lastly - pip install django-cors-headers

After all this dependencies download, the code will successfully.
